    <ol class="qa-src-list">
      <li id="src-1">Boarman, W.I. & Heinrich, B. (1999). Common Raven (<em>Corvus corax</em>). In Poole, A. (ed.), <em>The Birds of North America</em>, No. 476. Cornell Lab of Ornithology. — diet composition studies, invertebrate prey, plant food, seasonal diet shifts.</li>
